{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'ls -la; cat SUPPORT-TICKET.md; rg --files | head -80'","aggregated_output":"total 32\ndrwx------    9 valentinakoniukhova  wheel   288 Oct 19 00:17 .\ndrwxrwxrwt  178 root                 wheel  5696 Oct 19 00:17 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x   12 valentinakoniukhova  wheel   384 Oct 19 00:17 .git\n-rw-r--r--    1 valentinakoniukhova  wheel   571 Oct 19 00:17 README.md\n-rw-r--r--    1 valentinakoniukhova  wheel   452 Oct 19 00:17 SUPPORT-TICKET.md\n-rw-r--r--    1 valentinakoniukhova  wheel    44 Oct 19 00:17 analysis_options.yaml\ndrwxr-xr-x    7 valentinakoniukhova  wheel   224 Oct 19 00:17 lib\ndrwxr-xr-x    5 valentinakoniukhova  wheel   160 Oct 19 00:17 notes\n-rw-r--r--    1 valentinakoniukhova  wheel   335 Oct 19 00:17 pubspec.yaml\n# Ticket #4471: no session replays since the redesign\n\nReported by product, 2026-10-16.\n\nReplay tab in PostHog shows sessions only from users still on the old UI\n(the A/B group). Users on the new UI appear in Events (screens, taps,\n`loan_amount_changed`, `application_submitted` all arrive) but have no\nrecording. Project settings: Record user sessions = on, sampling 100%,\nminimum duration 0. Same posthog_flutter version for both groups, same build.\nSUPPORT-TICKET.md\nanalysis_options.yaml\nlib/new_app.dart\nlib/analytics.dart\nlib/main.dart\nlib/screens/application_screen.dart\nlib/screens/offers_screen.dart\nlib/screens/calculator_screen.dart\nlib/legacy_app.dart\nnotes/collecting-leads-with-apps-script.md\nnotes/badges-for-your-users-achievements.md\nnotes/posthog-session-replay-not-working-in-flutter.md\npubspec.yaml\nREADME.md\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
